es."},{"type":"h","text":"Characterisation skills"},{"type":"p","text":"A Research Associate should understand what an instrument measures, how the measurement works and how to interpret its limitations."},{"type":"h","text":"Structural"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XRD"},{"text":"Electron diffraction"},{"text":"Raman spectroscopy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Morphological"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEM"},{"text":"TEM"},{"text":"AFM"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Chemical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XPS"},{"text":"EDS/EDX"},{"text":"FTIR"},{"text":"Raman"},{"text":"ICP-based methods"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Thermal"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TGA"},{"text":"DSC"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Surface"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BET"},{"text":"Contact-angle analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Optical/electronic"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UV-Vis"},{"text":"Photoluminescence"},{"text":"Four-point probe"},{"text":"Hall measurements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mechanical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tensile testing"},{"text":"Hardness"},{"text":"Nanoindentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific computing"},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"SciPy"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"Jupyter"},{"text":"scikit-learn"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Apply Python to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Experimental data cleaning"},{"text":"Curve fitting"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Spectral analysis"},{"text":"XRD analysis"},{"text":"Image analysis"},{"text":"Automated plotting"},{"text":"Materials-property prediction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Additional tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MATLAB"},{"text":"Origin/OriginPro"},{"text":"ImageJ/Fiji"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"LaTeX"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced computational materials"},{"type":"p","text":"Later explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Density Functional Theory"},{"text":"Molecular dynamics"},{"text":"Finite-element modelling"},{"text":"Computational thermodynamics"},{"text":"High-performance computing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible tools include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Quantum ESPRESSO"},{"text":"LAMMPS"},{"text":"ASE"},{"text":"COMSOL"},{"text":"VASP, subject to access/licensing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research methodology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Identify a research problem"},{"text":"Search and review literature"},{"text":"Define a hypothesis"},{"text":"Design experiments"},{"text":"Prepare/control samples"},{"text":"Select characterisation methods"},{"text":"Collect reproducible data"},{"text":"Analyse results"},{"text":"Compare with published research"},{"text":"Identify limitations"},{"text":"Document experimental conditions"},{"text":"Write technical reports"},{"text":"Present findings"},{"text":"Propose follow-up experiments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research notebook"},{"type":"p","text":"Record:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sample ID"},{"text":"Materials and concentrations"},{"text":"Processing conditions"},{"text":"Equipment"},{"text":"Instrument parameters"},{"text":"Raw data"},{"text":"Analysis"},{"text":"Errors"},{"text":"Observations"},{"text":"Conclusions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Reproducibility is a core research skill."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Core skills","Potential future role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Nanomaterials"},{"text":"Synthesis + characterisation"},{"text":"Nanomaterials Scientist"}],[{"text":"Semiconductor Materials"},{"text":"Solid-state physics + fabrication"},{"text":"Semiconductor Scientist"}],[{"text":"Energy Materials"},{"text":"Electrochemistry + materials"},{"text":"Battery/Energy Materials Scientist"}],[{"text":"Biomaterials"},{"text":"Materials + biology"},{"text":"Biomaterials Scientist"}],[{"text":"2D Materials"},{"text":"Condensed matter + nanoscience"},{"text":"Advanced Materials Researcher"}],[{"text":"Polymer Materials"},{"text":"Polymer chemistry + processing"},{"text":"Polymer Scientist"}],[{"text":"Composite Materials"},{"text":"Mechanics + materials"},{"text":"Composite Materials Scientist"}],[{"text":"Computational Materials"},{"text":"Physics + Python + simulation"},{"text":"Computational Materials Scientist"}],[{"text":"Electronic Materials"},{"text":"Semiconductor/device physics"},{"text":"Electronic Materials Researcher"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Materials"},{"text":"Materials + environmental science"},{"text":"Sustainable Materials Scientist"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Research portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Build projects that demonstrate research ability, not just classroom knowledge."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — XRD analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Use an available dataset to investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Peak identification"},{"text":"Phase identification"},{"text":"Peak broadening"},{"text":"Crystallinity"},{"text":"Crystallite-size estimation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Nanomaterial synthesis"},{"type":"p","text":"Under laboratory supervision, study how one synthesis parameter affects:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Processing condition","Particle characteristics","Material property"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Materials image analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Use ImageJ/Python for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Particle-size analysis"},{"text":"Grain-size analysis"},{"text":"Porosity estimation"},{"text":"Morphological analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Materials-property prediction"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Python model predicting a selected material property from composition/structure features."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Literature review"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"“Nanomaterials for next-generation energy storage.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Deliver:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literature map"},{"text":"Comparison table"},{"text":"R